<title>USA: Surgical Laser, C.R. Bard settle lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Surgical Laser, C.R. Bard settle lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERYVILLE 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Surgical Laser Technologies Inc said it and C.R. Bard settled their litigation in the United States District Court for the Eastern District of Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>The company did not specify the nature of the suit. Terms of the settlement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Officials from Surgical Laser were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>C.R. Bard officials could not be reached.</p>
</text>
